#-----------input file for the coupled channel eq code-------------#
#Pi_tot:total parity for (alpha+d),jd:parity for daughter nucleus 
#Sd: spin of d, jt: total J for 2b system, Ed: excitation of daughter nucleus


&channelbeta    beta%Pi_tot=1d0   beta%j_tot=1d0      
                beta%Pi_d=1d0     beta%jd=0.5d0       beta%Ed=0d0               
                beta%Pi_alpha=1d0 beta%j_alpha=0.5d0   /


&meshs       nr=100       ndiff=10000    rmax=7d0         /


&basisvar    nbasis=15   b=1.2d0   gamma=8d0  m=6d0               /


&systems    E=12d0    mass1=1d0    mass2=1d0     
            z1=1d0    z2=0d0                           /


&potentials str='t' v0=-72.15d0   r0=0d0  a=1.484d0           /




